From 058a8721378b509d3e02aefaf309e2a4fe818b6b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 23:34:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf(dsv41): row-parallel vision wo/w2, multi-image packing,
 and pixel cap downscaling

Upstream base: 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354.
Immediate base: a75357bba81e31e4f3085700f94b6a0b29aed44a.

Convert DeepSeek-V4.1 vision attn.wo, mlp.w2, and aligner.w2 from output-column
sharding (shard_dim=0) to row-parallel input-column sharding (shard_dim=1)
reduced deterministically via tensor_model_parallel_all_gather and
rank_order_sum, eliminating all intermediate all-gathers between wqkv/attention
and wo, mlp.w1 and mlp.w2, and aligner.w1 and aligner.w2 (130 -> 65 collectives
per pass), removing the 51.9 MiB full-intermediate workspace buffer, and keeping
wo/w2 output dimension N unsharded (1024/5120, multiple of 128 across TP2..TP8).

Handle wholly padded TP ranks on TP5 (rank 4) and TP7 (rank 6) where
valid_heads == 0 by zeroing local_branch and skipping redundant kernel launches
while participating in the row-parallel reduction.

Pack contiguous runs of images within the 9,216-patch ViT workspace and
3,072-row aligner workspace into batched passes (forward_batch / encode_images),
collapsing a 4-image prompt from 4x32 ViT loops (520 collectives under old
shard_dim=0, or 260 under sequential row-parallel) to 1x32 ViT loop (65
collectives), while honoring --mm-encoder-tp-mode data via
run_dp_sharded_vision_tower when configured.

Replace hard ValueError rejection on images exceeding VLLM_MAX_IMAGE_PIXELS with
aspect-ratio-preserving Pillow Image.draft() + Image.thumbnail(..., BILINEAR)
downscaling during decode so high-megapixel uploads stay bounded by
VLLM_MAX_IMAGE_PIXELS without HTTP 400 failures.

Quality: rank_order_sum reduction preserves bit-exact parity across all TP ranks
(0 differing bits across ranks on TP3..TP8) and matches the FP64 reference
within <= 2^-7 relative RMS error across TP3..TP8.
Tests: 116 passed across two fresh GPU container boots on sp8
(tests/kernels/test_deepseek_v41_tilelang_vision.py covering TP3..TP8,
multi-image packing, and data-parallel override;
tests/multimodal/media/test_image.py covering pixel-limit downscaling).
Upstream status: candidate-1107 qualification patch.
